  "description": "A comprehensive .NET SDK for Solana blockchain development. Features BIP-39/SLIP-39 mnemonic support, SLIP-10 HD key derivation, Ed25519 cryptography, multi-wallet discovery (Phantom, Solflare, Ledger), Program Derived Addresses, Associated Token Accounts, vanity address generation, and full Solana CLI keypair compatibility.",
